        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I *think* I can't reproduce. This is how I have it on your large file (and even larger):\r\n\r\nhttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24854248/212401246-ea6f0661-1c22-4ac3-95be-294591606388.mp4\r\n\r\nDo you experience lag on all or only some pairs? The usual reason for any kind of lag when dealing with mappings is that there is some other one which \"extends\" the trouble one. In that case (Neo)vim should wait for some time (`:h 'timeoutlen'`) because it is unsure if user is going to add another keys.\r\n\r\nTry executing `:imap (` (and other troubled keys) and seeing if there is anything else. ",
