            "body": "I do (and once again \"lag\" is like a hundredth of a second, just enough to notice/bother me). You can notice the cursor flicker from the left to the right pair as it is inserted.\r\n\r\nHowever, I removed all my plugins except for mini.pairs from my config and the lag was gone. So I guess I'll report back after further investigation.\r\n\r\nBTW, what software do you use to record videos? Thanks.",
